msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:59
#: 2edc5bc0c5364a16947be0b855c5321f
msgid "RC input is configured by default via the USART5 RX input. It supports all unidirectional serial RC protocols except PPM . The SBUS pin is inverted and tied to R5 for SBUS support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:61
#: 1da31b5e4ff04ac9a46b4d02b970d947
msgid "FPort :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` set to 4 (half-duplex).  See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:62
#: d104f76386e54e7faef3d78558fd0db7
msgid "CRSF/ELRS uses RX5/TX5."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:63
#: 902b9642cc244b7ead6b7d3e44ecb424
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T5 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:66
#: 2c4c3f2c24004cc6836ef4941186f7c7
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:67
#: f528896477a24155867facfc8cac9cb6
msgid "The DAKEFPV H743/Pro supports up to 14 outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus S1-4, LED on  separate pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs. M1-8, S1, and S2 support B-Directional DShot. OSD, S3-4 support only PWM. The LED output supports serial LED or DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:71
#: 1f8c1d1d9363432687376fe8a4b3d582
msgid "For the H743 Pro the outputs are in 7 groups: * M 1-4     in group1 * M 5,6     in group2 * M 7,8    in group3 * S 1,2    in group4 * S 3,4    in group5 * OSD    in group 6 * LED    in group 7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:80
#: b7ae2ca016884a6e88f8773f5ff49116
msgid "For the H743 the outputs are in 6 groups: * M 1-4     in group1 * M 5-8     in group2 * S 1,2    in group3 * S 3,4    in group4 * OSD    in group 5 * LED    in group 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:88
#: 6bb209f9e79f46078e9afddfc88c0338
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:93
#: 0849dc89d4bb4b9b9039c16b07f19e9d
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:94
#: 3149ed41f6ad4e559a6fb9ab00a89551
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up to 12S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:97
#: 061bd126e05047e0aace931519ce39b3
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are: * :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4 * :ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11 * :ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10 * :ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 16.0 * :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 83.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:105
#: ee7dab5272334c15a86957bb5cc5e6a1
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:106
#: 59c82ec527f747908eb93641c483f42b
msgid "ADC Pin 8 -> Analog RSSI voltage monitoring. Set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 and :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 8. For RSSI embedded in digital RC protocols like CRSF, set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:109
#: 27d9669e4b19481fbc25e4f316f49e79
msgid "Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:110
#: 2f431cbb3efb49909c5fde302a574a9e
msgid "The DAKEFPV H743/Pro does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:113
#: 2aab32a6690748af9e59a8aa31a91fc6
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:114
#: 8eaea0554b1e4c8bbb5cca2cc807fe41
msgid "GPIO 81 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and \"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2. By default RELAY1 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:117
#: f65811f2c5b34ef099e4d694926c14fa
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:118
#: 0f74661cd93645938b270d3ec25de09f
msgid "GPIO 82 controls the VTX power output to the connectors marked \"12V\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video power off. By default RELAY2 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:121
#: 1873d2734e2042a3be3a886c43414b68
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:122
#: 495927afce504138950c523683d38b0b
msgid "The DAKEFPVH743/Pro has an onboard OSD using a MAX7456 chip and is enabled by default. The CAM1/2 and VTX pins provide connections for using the internal OSD. Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD is also possible and is configured by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:124
#: 4c7fd63722bc40f185508fa4de72e612
msgid "The HD VTX connector can have RX4 replaced by the analog VTX signal if that connector is used for analog VTX connection by using the DJI/VTX jumper pads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:127
#: d9dc5761ecbe497bbf578d68b7e59b1e
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:128
#: 988df94299594ac3bed952e2b6b67753
msgid "Firmware for the H743 PRO version can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"DAKEFPVH743Pro\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:130
#: 7e51ab76b6624e098676aed557539075
msgid "Firmware for the H743 version can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"DAKEFPVH743\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:132
#: beeab695819d4459bc147aedfac278c3
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:136
#: f80931072ba0402ab4e87f5aa38fa83c
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""
